WebAuthnValidator::onInstall
├── given a fully non-zero (x, y) public key
│   └── when installed by the account
│       └── it should store (x, y) keyed by the account (pubKeyOf)
├── given a public key with x == 0 (half-zero)
│   └── when installed
│       └── it should revert with InvalidPubKey
├── given a public key with y == 0 (half-zero)
│   └── when installed
│       └── it should revert with InvalidPubKey
├── given a fully zero (0, 0) public key
│   └── when installed
│       └── it should revert with InvalidPubKey
└── given the credential was set then uninstalled
    └── when onUninstall is called
        └── it should clear (x, y) (pubKeyOf == 0)
